nd can know just how vile it is. At this time it was commonly known as No Man's Land. Why? Well, the emperor of Nilfgaard had not yet claimed it, Temeria was in disarray, and the Redanians had already retreated north. No Man had been left in charge, and he had proved a terrible ruler._\n\n**Rewards:**\n- 100 XP","Latitude":83.896826009281,"Longitude":-168.15860421072,"Media":[]},{"ExternalId":555279,"CategoryExternalId":642,"Title":"Old Letter","DescriptionMarkdown":"Inside the [Chest](https://mapgenie.io/witcher-3/maps/vizima-palace?locationIds=555278) found in a secret passage unlocked via [Hidden Switch](https://mapgenie.io/witcher-3/maps/vizima-palace?locationIds=555277#L).","Latitude":83.908021755625,"Longitude":-168.05290375973,"Media":[{"ExternalId":124332,"Title":"unedited019655","Source":"https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/84f1fb90-2c8c-4117-9e6b-ee8c65523c1a.jpg"}]},{"ExternalId":555283,"CategoryExternalId":642,"Title":"Letter found in Yennefer's chest","DescriptionMarkdown":"Inside the [Chest](https://mapgenie.io/witcher-3/maps/vizima-palace?locationIds=555281#L) which, as you might have guessed, belongs to Yennefer.","Latitude":83.908530521692,"Longitude":-168.2201437404,"Media":[{"ExternalId":124335,"Title":"unedited019657","Source":"https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/46108c09-f22f-4cda-93ef-82a9e0709e75.jpg"}]},{"ExternalId":555284,"CategoryExternalId":642,"Title":"Letter to Yennefer","DescriptionMarkdown":"","Latitude":83.909768145803,"Longitude":-168.18037785216,"Media":[{"ExternalId":124336,"Title":"unedited019658","Source":"https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/0fbabe01-00e9-4623-9c04-0ea877efc667.jpg"}]},{"ExternalId":959621,"CategoryExternalId":642,"Title":"The Last Wish","DescriptionMarkdown":"","Latitude":83.910533016076,"Longitude":-168.22101003101,"Media":[]},{"ExternalId":959622,"CategoryExternalId":642,"Title":"She Who Knows","DescriptionMarkdown":"","Latitude":83.906306822374,"Longitude":-168.17620641162,"Media":[]},{"ExternalI